{"title":"Career Roadmap · Clinical Documentation Specialist","role":"Clinical Documentation Specialist","summary":"A Clinical Documentation Specialist (CDS) reviews clinical records to identify documentation that may be incomplete, unclear, inconsistent or insufficiently specific.","facts":{"Current degree":"Allied Health Sciences (B.Sc / BPT / BOT / BMLT etc.)","Course":"Medical Records & Health Information"},"about":[{"label":"Important","text":"A Clinical Documentation Specialist (CDS) focuses on the completeness, clarity, accuracy and clinical integrity of patient documentation. In many organisations, the role is not a purely entry-level position and may prefer clinical experience, medical coding knowledge or a relevant health-information qualification. Exact eligibility varies by employer and country."}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Clinical Documentation Specialist (CDS) reviews clinical records to identify documentation that may be incomplete, unclear, inconsistent or insufficiently specific."},{"type":"h","text":"The role connects:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Physicians"},{"text":"Nurses"},{"text":"Medical coders"},{"text":"Health information teams"},{"text":"Quality teams"},{"text":"Clinical departments"},{"text":"Hospital administration"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The CDS does not invent diagnoses or change clinical facts. The core responsibility is to ensure that the patient's condition and care are accurately and clearly reflected in the clinical record through appropriate clinical clarification processes."},{"type":"h","text":"Career Flow"},{"type":"h","text":"Health Information / Allied Health Education"},{"type":"h","text":"Medical Terminology + Clinical Knowledge"},{"type":"h","text":"Medical Records / Coding Exposure"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Documentation Training"},{"type":"h","text":"CDI / Documentation Trainee"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Documentation Specialist"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior CDI Specialist"},{"type":"h","text":"CDI Quality / Audit Specialist"},{"type":"h","text":"CDI Manager / Clinical Documentation Lead"},{"type":"h","text":"Health Information / Clinical Data Leadership"}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Career Stage","Primary Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"Foundation"},{"text":"Anatomy, physiology, pathology, medical terminology"}],[{"text":"Records Stage"},{"text":"Medical records and documentation"}],[{"text":"Coding Stage"},{"text":"Diagnosis/procedure classification"}],[{"text":"CDI Training"},{"text":"Documentation quality and clinical indicators"}],[{"text":"Entry"},{"text":"Documentation review and query workflow"}],[{"text":"Intermediate"},{"text":"Complex chart review and CDI audits"}],[{"text":"Senior"},{"text":"Quality, education and physician engagement"}],[{"text":"Leadership"},{"text":"CDI programme management"}]]}]},{"heading":"Year 1 — Biomedical & Healthcare Foundation","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The first year should establish strong clinical and healthcare vocabulary."},{"type":"h","text":"Core Subjects"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Human Anatomy"},{"text":"Human Physiology"},{"text":"Biochemistry"},{"text":"Microbiology"},{"text":"Pathology"},{"text":"Medical Terminology"},{"text":"Introduction to Healthcare"},{"text":"Psychology"},{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Healthcare Systems"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Medical Terminology"},{"type":"h","text":"Master terminology related to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Body systems"},{"text":"Diseases"},{"text":"Symptoms"},{"text":"Signs"},{"text":"Procedures"},{"text":"Medications"},{"text":"Laboratory tests"},{"text":"Imaging"},{"text":"Surgical procedures"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Documentation Awareness"},{"type":"h","text":"Understand the purpose of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"History and physical"},{"text":"Progress notes"},{"text":"Consultation notes"},{"text":"Operative notes"},{"text":"Nursing notes"},{"text":"Discharge summaries"},{"text":"Procedure documentation"},{"text":"Investigation reports"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Clinical Medicine & Medical Records"},{"type":"p","text":"The second year should build enough clinical understanding to interpret patient records accurately."},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Areas"},{"type":"h","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"General Medicine"},{"text":"General Surgery"},{"text":"Pharmacology"},{"text":"Pathology"},{"text":"Microbiology"},{"text":"Cardiology"},{"text":"Respiratory medicine"},{"text":"Gastroenterology"},{"text":"Neurology"},{"text":"Nephrology"},{"text":"Endocrinology"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Medical Records"},{"type":"h","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Record creation"},{"text":"Record completion"},{"text":"Indexing"},{"text":"Record retrieval"},{"text":"Documentation standards"},{"text":"Record audits"},{"text":"Data quality"},{"text":"Confidentiality"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Documentation Principle"},{"type":"h","text":"Patient Condition"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Findings"},{"type":"h","text":"Investigations"},{"type":"h","text":"Treatment"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Documentation"},{"type":"h","text":"Accurate Health Record"},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Coding & Clinical Documentation Improvement"},{"type":"p","text":"This is the most important stage for building a CDS-oriented profile."},{"type":"h","text":"Medical Coding"},{"type":"h","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Diagnosis coding fundamentals"},{"text":"Procedure coding"},{"text":"ICD concepts"},{"text":"Coding guidelines"},{"text":"Documentation requirements"},{"text":"Clinical terminology"},{"text":"Coding audits"},{"text":"Coding-related discrepancies"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Indicators"},{"type":"h","text":"Learn how documentation relates to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Laboratory results"},{"text":"Imaging"},{"text":"Vital signs"},{"text":"Medication"},{"text":"Procedures"},{"text":"Nursing observations"},{"text":"Treatment intensity"},{"text":"Length of stay"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Documentation Review"},{"type":"h","text":"Look for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Missing specificity"},{"text":"Conflicting documentation"},{"text":"Incomplete diagnoses"},{"text":"Unclear clinical relationships"},{"text":"Inconsistent terminology"},{"text":"Missing clinical indicators"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The CDS should identify potential documentation gaps and follow approved clarification/query processes rather than independently assigning unsupported diagnoses."}]},{"heading":"Final Year / Internship — Clinical Documentation Practice","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["The final stage should combine clinical knowledge","records","coding","documentation review."],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Rotations"},{"type":"h","text":"Medical Records"},{"type":"h","text":"Medical Coding"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Departments"},{"type":"h","text":"Discharge Documentation"},{"type":"h","text":"Quality Department"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Documentation Review"},{"type":"h","text":"CDI Audit"},{"type":"h","text":"High-Value Clinical Areas"},{"type":"h","text":"Gain exposure to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"General medicine"},{"text":"Surgery"},{"text":"Cardiology"},{"text":"Respiratory medicine"},{"text":"Neurology"},{"text":"Nephrology"},{"text":"Orthopaedics"},{"text":"Critical care"},{"text":"Emergency medicine"}]}]},{"heading":"Clinical Documentation Review Workflow","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A typical CDI workflow can be represented as:"},{"type":"h","text":"Patient Chart"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Review"},{"type":"h","text":"Identify Clinical Indicators"},{"type":"h","text":"Compare Documentation"},{"type":"h","text":"Identify Potential Documentation Gap"},{"type":"h","text":"Apply CDI Guidelines"},{"type":"h","text":"Clarification / Query if Appropriate"},{"type":"h","text":"Provider Response"},{"type":"h","text":"Updated Accurate Documentation"},{"type":"h","text":"Coding / Reporting"},{"type":"p","text":"The exact workflow depends on the organisation's CDI policy and applicable standards."}]},{"heading":"Essential Clinical Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Skill","Importance"],"rows":[[{"text":"Medical Terminology"},{"text":"★★★★★"}],[{"text":"Anatomy & Physiology"},{"text":"★★★★★"}],[{"text":"Pathology"},{"text":"★★★★★"}],[{"text":"Clinical Documentation"},{"text":"★★★★★"}],[{"text":"Medical Coding"},{"text":"★★★★★"}],[{"text":"Chart Review"},{"text":"★★★★★"}],[{"text":"Clinical Reasoning"},{"text":"★★★★★"}],[{"text":"Documentation Audit"},{"text":"★★★★★"}],[{"text":"Physician Communication"},{"text":"★★★★★"}],[{"text":"Data Quality"},{"text":"★★★★★"}],[{"text":"Hospital Workflow"},{"text":"★★★★☆"}],[{"text":"Health Information Management"},{"text":"★★★★★"}],[{"text":"Medical Statistics"},{"text":"★★★★☆"}],[{"text":"Research Skills"},{"text":"★★★☆☆"}]]}]},{"heading":"Clinical Chart Review Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A CDS should learn to review a chart systematically."},{"type":"h","text":"Review Structure"},{"type":"h","text":"Patient Demographics"},{"type":"h","text":"Reason for Admission"},{"type":"h","text":"History & Examination"},{"type":"h","text":"Diagnoses"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Indicators"},{"type":"h","text":"Investigations"},{"type":"h","text":"Treatment"},{"type":"h","text":"Procedures"},{"type":"h","text":"Progress"},{"type":"h","text":"Discharge Documentation"},{"type":"h","text":"Look For"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Clinical consistency"},{"text":"Documentation completeness"},{"text":"Specificity"},{"text":"Severity indicators"},{"text":"Complications"},{"text":"Comorbidities"},{"text":"Procedure documentation"},{"text":"Clinical evidence supporting documented conditions"}]}]},{"heading":"Medical Coding Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Coding knowledge is one of the strongest differentiators for a CDS."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"ICD classification concepts"},{"text":"Diagnosis terminology"},{"text":"Procedure terminology"},{"text":"Coding guidelines"},{"text":"Principal diagnosis concepts"},{"text":"Secondary diagnoses"},{"text":"Complication documentation"},{"text":"Comorbidity documentation"},{"text":"Documentation-to-code relationship"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Coding Relationship"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Condition"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Evidence"},{"type":"h","text":"Provider Documentation"},{"type":"h","text":"Coding Rules"},{"type":"h","text":"Code Assignment"},{"type":"p","text":"The CDS should understand coding deeply enough to recognise when documentation may not adequately represent the patient's clinical complexity, while leaving final coding decisions to appropriately authorized coding professionals."}]},{"heading":"CDI Query Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A major advanced skill is professional clinical clarification."},{"type":"h","text":"A good query should be:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Clinically supported"},{"text":"Objective"},{"text":"Non-leading"},{"text":"Professionally worded"},{"text":"Based on available documentation"},{"text":"Consistent with organisational policy"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Example Structure"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Indicators"},{"type":"h","text":"Relevant Documentation"},{"type":"h","text":"Clarification Needed"},{"type":"h","text":"Provider Query"},{"type":"h","text":"Provider Response"},{"type":"h","text":"Final Documentation"},{"type":"p","text":"Avoid designing queries that pressure clinicians toward a particular diagnosis."}]},{"heading":"Digital & Health Information Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Core Systems"},{"type":"h","text":"Learn familiarity with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"EHR"},{"text":"EMR"},{"text":"HIS"},{"text":"Clinical documentation systems"},{"text":"Medical coding systems"},{"text":"Document management systems"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Digital Skills"},{"type":"table","header":["Tool","Application"],"rows":[[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"CDI tracking and audits"}],[{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Documentation dashboards"}],[{"text":"EHR/EMR"},{"text":"Chart review"}],[{"text":"HIS"},{"text":"Hospital workflow"}],[{"text":"Coding Software"},{"text":"Classification"}],[{"text":"Word"},{"text":"Query/documentation preparation"}],[{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Basic healthcare data analysis"}]]}]},{"heading":"CDI Analytics","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Modern CDI programmes are increasingly data-driven."},{"type":"h","text":"Useful Metrics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Records reviewed"},{"text":"Documentation opportunities"},{"text":"Query rate"},{"text":"Query response rate"},{"text":"Documentation improvement rate"},{"text":"Provider response time"},{"text":"Audit accuracy"},{"text":"Case mix indicators"},{"text":"Record completion rate"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Dashboard Example"},{"type":"h","text":"CDI Dashboard"},{"type":"h","text":"│"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Charts Reviewed"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Documentation Opportunities"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Queries Issued"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Response Rate"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Query Turnaround"},{"type":"h","text":"└── Audit Accuracy"}]},{"heading":"Recommended Projects","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Clinical Chart Review Portfolio"},{"type":"h","text":"Create educational case reviews showing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Patient presentation"},{"text":"Clinical findings"},{"text":"Investigations"},{"text":"Documented diagnoses"},{"text":"Potential documentation gaps"},{"text":"Appropriate clarification approach"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Use anonymized or simulated cases."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — CDI Audit"},{"type":"h","text":"Build an audit framework measuring:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Documentation completeness"},{"text":"Diagnosis specificity"},{"text":"Missing clinical indicators"},{"text":"Discharge documentation quality"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Coding & Documentation Casebook"},{"type":"h","text":"Create cases showing:"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Presentation"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Indicators"},{"type":"h","text":"Provider Documentation"},{"type":"h","text":"Coding Implication"},{"type":"h","text":"Documentation Opportunity"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — CDI Dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Create an Excel/Power BI dashboard tracking:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Chart volume"},{"text":"Queries"},{"text":"Responses"},{"text":"Documentation gaps"},{"text":"Department performance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — Physician Query Template Library"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop educational templates for common documentation clarification scenarios, ensuring each template is neutral, evidence-based and compliant with the organisation's policies."}]},{"heading":"Internship Strategy","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Priority Departments"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Medical Records"},{"text":"Clinical Documentation"},{"text":"Medical Coding"},{"text":"General Medicine"},{"text":"Surgery"},{"text":"Critical Care"},{"text":"Emergency Medicine"},{"text":"Quality Department"},{"text":"Health Information Management"},{"text":"Hospital Analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Ideal Internship Progression"},{"type":"h","text":"Medical Records"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Department Exposure"},{"type":"h","text":"Coding"},{"type":"h","text":"Chart Review"},{"type":"h","text":"Documentation Audit"},{"type":"h","text":"CDI Workflow"}]},{"heading":"Entry-Level Roles","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Because Clinical Documentation Specialist positions can prefer prior clinical/coding experience, these can be realistic entry routes:"},{"type":"table","header":["Role","Entry Potential"],"rows":[[{"text":"CDI Trainee"},{"text":"★★★★★"}],[{"text":"Clinical Documentation Associate"},{"text":"★★★★★"}],[{"text":"Medical Records Executive"},{"text":"★★★★★"}],[{"text":"Medical Coding Associate"},{"text":"★★★★★"}],[{"text":"Clinical Data Associate"},{"text":"★★★★☆"}],[{"text":"Health Information Executive"},{"text":"★★★★★"}],[{"text":"Documentation Quality Associate"},{"text":"★★★★☆"}],[{"text":"Medical Coding Auditor Trainee"},{"text":"★★★☆☆"}],[{"text":"Clinical Documentation Specialist"},{"text":"★★★☆☆"}]]},{"type":"note","label":"Best strategy","text":"gain medical-record/coding experience while building CDI-specific skills, then transition into a specialist role."}]},{"heading":"Employer Skill Matrix","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Employer Type","Most Valuable Skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"Multi-specialty Hospital"},{"text":"Chart review + clinical knowledge"}],[{"text":"Corporate Hospital"},{"text":"CDI + EHR + coding"}],[{"text":"Health Information Company"},{"text":"Coding + documentation"}],[{"text":"Medical Coding Organisation"},{"text":"Coding + clinical terminology"}],[{"text":"Clinical Research Organisation"},{"text":"Documentation + data quality"}],[{"text":"Hospital Quality Department"},{"text":"Audit + documentation"}],[{"text":"Health-tech Company"},{"text":"EHR + clinical data"}],[{"text":"Revenue Cycle Organisation"},{"text":"Coding + documentation"}],[{"text":"Healthcare Consultancy"},{"text":"CDI analytics + process improvement"}]]}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Additional Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"High Priority"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Medical terminology"},{"text":"Medical coding"},{"text":"ICD coding fundamentals"},{"text":"Clinical documentation improvement"},{"text":"Health Information Management"},{"text":"Advanced Excel"},{"text":"EHR/HIS"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Strong Differentiators"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Clinical Documentation Improvement training"},{"text":"Coding audit"},{"text":"Healthcare quality"},{"text":"Clinical data analytics"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Health informatics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"International Career Preparation"},{"type":"p","text":"Students targeting international CDI/HIM markets should research the current credential and experience requirements of the specific country and employer, because professional expectations differ significantly."}]},{"heading":"Higher Education","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Health Information"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MSc Health Informatics"},{"text":"MSc Health Information Management"},{"text":"MSc Medical Informatics"},{"text":"Healthcare Informatics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Hospital Management"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MBA Healthcare Management"},{"text":"Master of Hospital Administration"},{"text":"Healthcare Quality Management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical / Public Health"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MPH"},{"text":"Epidemiology"},{"text":"Clinical Research"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Data-Oriented"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Health Data Science"},{"text":"Healthcare Analytics"},{"text":"Medical Informatics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Strong Combination"},{"type":"h","text":"Allied Health / HIM Degree"},{"type":"h","text":"Medical Records + Coding"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Documentation Experience"},{"type":"h","text":"Health Informatics / Management PG"},{"type":"h","text":"CDI Leadership / Health Information Management"}]},{"heading":"Career Specializations","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"1. Clinical Documentation Improvement"},{"type":"h","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Chart review"},{"text":"Documentation gaps"},{"text":"Provider queries"},{"text":"Documentation quality"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2. CDI Audit"},{"type":"h","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Query quality"},{"text":"Documentation accuracy"},{"text":"Process compliance"},{"text":"Quality assurance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"3. Clinical Coding"},{"type":"h","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Diagnosis coding"},{"text":"Procedure coding"},{"text":"Coding accuracy"},{"text":"Coding audits"}]},{"type":"h","text":"4. Health Information Management"},{"type":"h","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Medical records"},{"text":"EHR"},{"text":"Information governance"},{"text":"Data quality"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5. CDI Analytics"},{"type":"h","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CDI dashboards"},{"text":"Quality metrics"},{"text":"Trend analysis"},{"text":"Programme performance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"6. Clinical Informatics"},{"type":"h","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"EHR optimisation"},{"text":"Clinical workflows"},{"text":"Data systems"},{"text":"Digital health"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"CDI Route"},{"type":"h","text":"CDI Trainee"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Documentation Associate"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Documentation Specialist"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior CDI Specialist"},{"type":"h","text":"CDI Auditor / Quality Specialist"},{"type":"h","text":"CDI Lead"},{"type":"h","text":"CDI Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Documentation Programme Director"},{"type":"h","text":"HIM Route"},{"type":"h","text":"CDS"},{"type":"h","text":"Health Information Specialist"},{"type":"h","text":"HIM Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"Health Informatics Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"Healthcare Information Leadership"},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics Route"},{"type":"h","text":"CDS"},{"type":"h","text":"CDI Data Analyst"},{"type":"h","text":"Healthcare Data Analyst"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Healthcare Analyst"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Informatics / Analytics Lead"}]},{"heading":"Emerging Technologies","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"AI-Assisted Documentation Review"},{"type":"h","text":"AI can help identify:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Potential documentation gaps"},{"text":"Clinical indicators"},{"text":"Missing specificity"},{"text":"Documentation inconsistencies"},{"text":"Relevant chart sections"}]},{"type":"p","text":"However, AI should support—not replace—professional clinical review and organisational CDI processes."},{"type":"h","text":"NLP"},{"type":"h","text":"Natural Language Processing can analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Physician notes"},{"text":"Discharge summaries"},{"text":"Progress notes"},{"text":"Operative reports"},{"text":"Clinical narratives"}]},{"type":"p","text":"and identify potentially relevant clinical concepts."},{"type":"h","text":"Automated Coding Assistance"},{"type":"p","text":"AI-assisted coding can increasingly connect:"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Text"},{"type":"h","text":"NLP"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Concepts"},{"type":"h","text":"Potential Codes"},{"type":"h","text":"Human Validation"},{"type":"h","text":"Predictive CDI Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Future systems may predict which charts are most likely to contain documentation opportunities, allowing specialists to prioritise high-value cases."}]},{"heading":"Recommended Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Foundation"},{"type":"h","text":"Anatomy"},{"type":"h","text":"+ Physiology"},{"type":"h","text":"+ Pathology"},{"type":"h","text":"+ Pharmacology"},{"type":"h","text":"+ Medical Terminology"},{"type":"h","text":"+ Clinical Medicine"},{"type":"h","text":"CDI Core"},{"type":"h","text":"Chart Review"},{"type":"h","text":"+ Clinical Indicators"},{"type":"h","text":"+ Documentation Standards"},{"type":"h","text":"+ Provider Queries"},{"type":"h","text":"+ Coding Knowledge"},{"type":"h","text":"+ Documentation Audit"},{"type":"h","text":"Digital"},{"type":"h","text":"EHR / EMR"},{"type":"h","text":"+ HIS"},{"type":"h","text":"+ Excel"},{"type":"h","text":"+ Pow