Internship"},{"text":"1"}],[{"text":"Clinical Department Rotations"},{"text":"Multiple"}],[{"text":"EHR/HIS Exposure"},{"text":"Demonstrable"}],[{"text":"Healthcare Data Project"},{"text":"1"}],[{"text":"CDI Research Report"},{"text":"1"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Portfolio Structure"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Documentation Portfolio"},{"type":"h","text":"│"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Clinical Chart Reviews"},{"type":"h","text":"├── CDI Casebook"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Coding Casebook"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Documentation Audit"},{"type":"h","text":"├── CDI Dashboard"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Query Examples"},{"type":"h","text":"└── Hospital Internship"}]},{"heading":"Best Overall Positioning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The strongest graduate profile should be:"},{"type":"p","text":"A clinically knowledgeable health-information professional who can review medical records, identify documentation opportunities, understand coding implications, communicate effectively with clinical teams and use digital health systems for documentation quality improvement."},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Positioning"},{"type":"h","text":"Allied Health / Health Information Education"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical + Medical Terminology Foundation"},{"type":"h","text":"Medical Records"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Medicine"},{"type":"h","text":"Medical Coding"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Chart Review"},{"type":"h","text":"Documentation Improvement"},{"type":"h","text":"EHR / HIS"},{"type":"h","text":"CDI Internship / Trainee Experience"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Documentation Specialist"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior CDI Specialist"},{"type":"h","text":"CDI Quality / Analytics"},{"type":"h","text":"CDI Lead / Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"Highest-value combination:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Clinical Knowledge","Medical Coding","Chart Review","CDI","EHR/HIS","Data Analytics","Physician Communication."],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"For this career, the most important distinction is that a CDS should become an expert in accurately representing the patient's documented clinical story, not simply a person who edits medical records."},{"type":"table","header":["ID","Level","Discipline","Degree","Specialization","Target Career"],"rows":[[{"text":"2119"},{"text":"UG"},{"text":"Nursing & Allied Health"},{"text":"Allied Health Sciences (B.Sc / BPT / BOT / BMLT etc.)"},{"text":"Clinical Nutrition & Dietetics"},{"text":"Clinical Dietitian"}]]}]}]}